at you say but I'll fight  to the death for your right to say it we  are not supposed to be carbon copies of  each other so the sisters are very  different and they argue in this film  and they if they'd have disagreements  but they're the fierce loyalty comes  from this undercurrent of love and it is  okay to disagree with the people that  you love thank you all for putting this  together and I think the audience had a  great time today
 

